# Liquid Glass

Pulpo uses a custom `LiquidGlass` widget (`lib/src/core/theme/liquid_glass.dart`): BackdropFilter blur + translucent gradient + hairline specular edge. It is **floating chrome**, not a new app theme.

## Use it

- Bottom navigation pill (`BudgetBottomNav`)
- Modal bottom sheets that float over content (quick actions, pickers)
- Overlay chips / floating headers that sit on scrolling content

## Do not use it

- Dense lists, transaction tiles, form fields, settings rows
- Data cards (balance, budgets, reports) — keep solid `surface` / `emphasized`
- Full-screen backgrounds (lock, onboarding)

Glass only works if content **scrolls behind** it (`Scaffold.extendBody`, extra list bottom padding). Do not replace solid fills with glass on screens that have a flat background and no overlay.

When Flutter ships official Cupertino Liquid Glass, wrap through `LiquidGlass` so call sites stay one widget.
